1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:04,153
Enzymes are protein biocatalysts made by living cells.

2
00:00:04,153 --> 00:00:07,786
Each has an active site, a pocket of a definite shape.

3
00:00:07,786 --> 00:00:12,408
Only a substrate of the matching shape fits, like a key in a lock.

4
00:00:12,408 --> 00:00:14,570
A wrong shape simply does not fit.

